{"unit_id":"hutao562__dsh-remote-dsh#feature-1","repo":"hutao562/dsh-remote-dsh","commit":"f074c7e6c53d8a96fb534dd481409fc5b85d5e9a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-dsh 的功能「远程界面接管」：侧边栏的「远程」入口打开整页覆盖层，并在 iframe 中显示选定主机的 DSH Web；返回按钮可回到本地界面。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1305","lib/client.js:1320","lib/client.js:1073"]}
{"unit_id":"hutao562__dsh-remote-dsh#feature-2","repo":"hutao562/dsh-remote-dsh","commit":"f074c7e6c53d8a96fb534dd481409fc5b85d5e9a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-dsh 的功能「远程主机管理」：可通过面板添加、编辑、选择或删除主机；服务端将主机列表写入 DSH_HOME 下的 remote-dsh.json。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:857","lib/client.js:875","lib/index.js:287","lib/index.js:934"]}
{"unit_id":"hutao562__dsh-remote-dsh#feature-3","repo":"hutao562/dsh-remote-dsh","commit":"f074c7e6c53d8a96fb534dd481409fc5b85d5e9a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-dsh 的功能「连通性探测」：面板定期请求本机服务端探测所选主机，并显示端口不可达或 DSH 已响应等连接状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:821","lib/index.js:805","lib/index.js:334"]}
{"unit_id":"hutao562__dsh-remote-dsh#feature-4","repo":"hutao562/dsh-remote-dsh","commit":"f074c7e6c53d8a96fb534dd481409fc5b85d5e9a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-dsh 的功能「远程会话状态徽标」：侧栏汇总 peer 报告的等待答复、运行和新近完成会话数量；打开远程视图会清除该主机的未读活动计数。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:350","lib/client.js:435","lib/index.js:658"]}
{"unit_id":"hutao562__dsh-remote-dsh#caveat-1","repo":"hutao562/dsh-remote-dsh","commit":"f074c7e6c53d8a96fb534dd481409fc5b85d5e9a","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-dsh 使用前须知：嵌入的远端地址应映射到本机回环端口；公开域名或直接 IP 的跨站 iframe 无法依赖远端 SameSite=Strict 会话 cookie。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:511","lib/client.js:1055","lib/index.js:127"]}
